      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is the other half of the problem noted on src/dsp/platform.c. pldm_msgbuf_extract_sensor_data() just above is guarded for the 64-bit tags:\n\n    case PLDM_SENSOR_DATA_SIZE_UINT64:\n    case PLDM_SENSOR_DATA_SIZE_SINT64:\n            return -EINVAL;\n\nand so is pldm__msgbuf_extract_range_field_format() below. This one isn\u0027t, and it\u0027s the one writing through a void * whose size it cannot know - the comment above the function already calls that out.\n\nIf the 64-bit capable path goes through a new entry point instead, this helper can stay guarded like its neighbours.",
